---
/* Marca provisional: una «C» abierta con un nivel horizontal (criterio = medir antes de actuar). */
interface Props { size?: number; wordmark?: boolean }
const { size = 30, wordmark = true } = Astro.props;
---
<span class="logo">
  <svg width={size} height={size} viewBox="0 0 32 32" aria-hidden="true">
    <rect width="32" height="32" rx="8" fill="var(--teal)" />
    <path d="M22.5 10.2A8 8 0 1 0 22.5 21.8" fill="none" stroke="var(--paper)" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" />
    <path d="M12.5 16h11" stroke="var(--ochre-bright)" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" />
  </svg>
  {wordmark && <span class="word">Criterio</span>}
</span>
<style>
  .logo { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; }
  .word { font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.35rem; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
</style>
